      </nav>
      <h1 class="ed-title">Schwinn Treadmills: The Current Range and the Models You Will See Used</h1>
      <p class="ed-dek">
        Schwinn is better known for bikes, but Schwinn Fitness sells four folding treadmills in the US, all between $699 and $1,099. The 810 is the one most people search for; the newer 815, SFT4.1 and SFT4.3 sit around it, and the 830 and 870 are gone. This guide sets out what each costs and what Schwinn does and does not publish about them, who owns Schwinn Fitness now, and when a Bowflex from the same owner is the better buy.
      </p>

