        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="44" height="44" />
        <div class="ed-byline-text">
          By <a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a><br />
          Updated November 5, 2026 · Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS
        </div>
        <a href="#top-picks" class="btn-ghost">View products</a>
      </div>
      <p class="ed-disclosure">
        We research every product on this page independently. If you buy through our links, we may earn a
        commission at no cost to you. <a href="/editorial-standards/">Learn more about how we review.</a>
      </p>

      <figure class="ed-hero">
        <div class="ed-hero-collage">
          <a href="#schwinn-810"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41q5bpFisiL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Schwinn 810" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#schwinn-sft4-3"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31B3H544RJL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Schwinn SFT4.3" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
          <a href="#schwinn-815"><img src="https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31rZqeS4OhL._SL500_.jpg" alt="Schwinn 815" width="500" height="500" decoding="async" /></a>
        </div>
        <figcaption>Schwinn 810 · Schwinn SFT4.3 · Schwinn 815</figcaption>
      </figure>

      <div class="ed-body prose prose-lg">
        <p class="ed-lead">
          Schwinn treadmills are easy to misread. The brand on the frame is the same one on a century of American
          bicycles, but the bicycles belong to Pacific Cycle and the fitness equipment to an entirely separate
          business: Schwinn Fitness, built up by Nautilus Inc. and owned since April 2024 by Johnson Health Tech,
          which also makes Horizon, Matrix and Bowflex. So yes, Schwinn still sells treadmills in the US — four of
          them on the day we checked — but they are budget folding machines, Schwinn publishes no motor ratings for
          any of them, and the warranty is short outside the frame and motor. Here is what each model offers, which
          older Schwinns you will meet second-hand, and how to choose.
        </p>

