          listings for the SFT4.1 and SFT4.3, TreadmillReviews.com's and Garage Gym Reviews' coverage of the
          discontinued 830 and 870, bankruptcy-sale coverage of BowFlex Inc. in 2024, Bowflex's US treadmill page,
          and the US Consumer Product Safety Commission's recall database for Schwinn, Nautilus and Johnson Health
          Tech. Figures on the Schwinn cards are Schwinn's own, cross-checked where an independent source exists; the
          Horizon 7.0 AT card, which replaced a Bowflex T6 card on 9 November 2026 because Amazon does not sell the T6,
          carries the figures checked for our budget treadmill guide;
          conflicts are set out in the text and kept off the cards. Prices change often. We have not tested any
          Schwinn treadmill. As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases; that does not change what we
          say.
        </aside>

