            <li><a href="#motors-warranty">Motors and Warranty</a></li>
            <li><a href="#recalls">Schwinn Treadmill Recalls</a></li>
            <li><a href="#which">Which Schwinn Treadmill Should You Buy?</a></li>
            <li><a href="#where-to-buy">Where to Buy a Schwinn Treadmill</a></li>
            <li><a href="#faq">Frequently asked questions</a></li>
          </ol>
